        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International PH-7000, 12 Inch Clear Acrylic Radiance Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 12 Inch Radiance Acrylic Appliance Pull is a transitional refrigerator handle perfect for your kitchen remodel. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware needed to install it on an appliance panel. The 12 Inch Clear Acrylic Radiance Appliance Pull is available in satin nickel, polished nickel, and polished brass mounting bracket finishes--all of which pair beautifully with the crystal clear acrylic pull. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe PH-7000 Radiance Collection Appliance Pull is not just for refrigerators. Add a cohesive and look throughout your kitchen by adding them to every appliance in your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available in The Radiance Collection: <a href=\"/products/1-3-8-inch-radiance-acrylic-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-70\"><b>Small Radiance Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/2-inch-radiance-acrylic-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-71\"><b>Large Radiance Cabinet Knob</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/radiance-clear-acrylic-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-470\"><b>Radiance Cabinet Pull</b></a>, and <a href=\"/products/18-inch-radiance-acrylic-appliance-pull-rk-international-ph-7001\"><b>18 Inch Radiance Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 12\" Radiance Collection Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Handle Material: Clear Acrylic</li>\r\n<li>Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Thickness: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
